---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
import Carouselchill from "../components/Carouselchill.astro";
---

<Layout>
	<body class="h-full w-full flex flex-col justify-center items-center">
		<div
			class="w-full lg:min-w-[800px] mt-8 py-9 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center items-center md:items-center animate-fade-in animate-delay-200 animate-duration-slow"
		>
			<div class="text-start max-w-[280px] md:max-w-[400px]">
				<div class="">
					<h1 class="text-3xl text-dark font-sans">
						<b>Mandados Ahora</b>
					</h1>
					<p class="text-md">
						Ofrecemos a nuestros clientes la comodidad de <b
							>recibir sus productos directamente en la puerta de
							su hogar en
						</b>
						<b class="text-[#377DEC]">San Miguel del Monte.</b>
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="w-full flex items-center justify-start my-2">
					<a
						href="#servicios"
						class="bg-[#67a7f3] hover:bg-[#377DEC] text-white
						mr-2 mb-2 px-2.5 py-1.5
						 font-medium text-center
						justify-center inline-flex items-center flex-row
						rounded-lg border gap-x-2 opacity-90
						cursor-pointer hover:bg-kai-hover dark:bg-kai-hover dark:hover:bg-kai-bg hover:text-white
						hover:opacity-100 hover:bg-black-600
						hover:scale-110 hover:shadow-lg
						dark:focus:ring-black-300
						focus:ring-2 focus:outline-none focus:ring-black-30
						transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out scale-90"
					>
						Servicios
					</a>
					<a
						href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61584653608264"
						class="bg-[#67a7f3] hover:bg-[#377DEC]
						mr-2 mb-2 px-2.5 py-1.5
						 font-medium text-center
						justify-center inline-flex items-center flex-row
						rounded-lg border gap-x-2 opacity-90
						cursor-pointer hover:bg-kai-hover dark:bg-kai-hover dark:hover:bg-kai-bg hover:text-white
						hover:opacity-100 hover:bg-black-600
						hover:scale-110 hover:shadow-lg
						dark:focus:ring-black-300
						focus:ring-2 focus:outline-none focus:ring-black-30
						transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out scale-90"
						target="_blank"
						><svg
							xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
							width="24"
							height="24"
							viewBox="0 0 24 24"
							fill="none"
							stroke="#fff"
							stroke-width="2"
							stroke-linecap="round"
							stroke-linejoin="round"
							class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-brand-facebook"
							><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"
							></path><path
								d="M7 10v4h3v7h4v-7h3l1 -4h-4v-2a1 1 0 0 1 1 -1h3v-4h-3a5 5 0 0 0 -5 5v2h-3"
							></path></svg
						></a
					>
					<a
						href="https://www.instagram.com/mandadosahora/"
						class="bg-[#67a7f3] hover:bg-[#377DEC]
						mr-2 mb-2 px-2.5 py-1.5
						 font-medium text-center
						justify-center inline-flex items-center flex-row
						rounded-lg border gap-x-2 opacity-90
						cursor-pointer dark:bg-kai-hover dark:hover:bg-kai-bg hover:bg-kai-hover hover:text-white
						hover:opacity-100 hover:bg-black-600
						hover:scale-110 hover:shadow-lg
						dark:focus:ring-black-300
						focus:ring-2 focus:outline-none focus:ring-black-30
						transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out scale-90"
						target="_blank"
						><svg
							xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
							width="24"
							height="24"
							viewBox="0 0 24 24"
							fill="none"
							stroke="#fff"
							stroke-width="2"
							stroke-linecap="round"
							stroke-linejoin="round"
							class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-brand-instagram"
							><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"
							></path><path
								d="M4 8a4 4 0 0 1 4 -4h8a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v8a4 4 0 0 1 -4 4h-8a4 4 0 0 1 -4 -4z"
							></path><path d="M9 12a3 3 0 1 0 6 0a3 3 0 0 0 -6 0"
							></path><path d="M16.5 7.5v.01"></path></svg
						></a
					>
					<a
						href="https://www.instagram.com/mandadosahora/"
						class="bg-[#67a7f3] hover:bg-[#377DEC]
						mr-2 mb-2 px-2.5 py-1.5
						 font-medium text-center
						justify-center inline-flex items-center flex-row
						rounded-lg border gap-x-2 opacity-90
						cursor-pointer dark:bg-kai-hover dark:hover:bg-kai-bg hover:bg-kai-hover hover:text-white
						hover:opacity-100 hover:bg-black-600
						hover:scale-110 hover:shadow-lg
						dark:focus:ring-black-300
						focus:ring-2 focus:outline-none focus:ring-black-30
						transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out scale-90"
						target="_blank"
						><svg
							xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
							width="24"
							height="24"
							viewBox="0 0 24 24"
							fill="none"
							stroke="#fff"
							stroke-width="2"
							stroke-linecap="round"
							stroke-linejoin="round"
							class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-brand-whatsapp"
							><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"
							></path><path
								d="M3 21l1.65 -3.8a9 9 0 1 1 3.4 2.9l-5.05 .9"
							></path><path
								d="M9 10a.5 .5 0 0 0 1 0v-1a.5 .5 0 0 0 -1 0v1a5 5 0 0 0 5 5h1a.5 .5 0 0 0 0 -1h-1a.5 .5 0 0 0 0 1"
							></path></svg
						></a
					>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="w-fit md:w-fit flex justify-center mt-8">
				<img
					src="/o.avif"
					class="w-[150px] md:w-[250px] md:h-[250px]
							animate-shake animate-infinite animate-duration-[1500ms] animate-delay-0"
					alt="Carrito"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>
		<br id="servicios" class="" />
		<div class="flex flex-col justify-center mt-9 items-center">
			<h2
				class="text-start text-2xl underline mb-2 max-w-[350px] md:w-full md:min-w-[450px]"
			>
				<b>Servicios:</b>
			</h2>
			<div
				class="style-none list-disc grid grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 w-fit text-md text-serif dark:text-white"
			>
				<a href="/servicios/mercado" class="w-fit flex flex-col group">
					<div
						class="relative hover:cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 hover:contrast-125 transition z-10 col-span-2 min-h-[100px] min-w-[100px] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#F4D992] via-[#eec15b] to-[#eaaa35] p-2 w-fit border rounded-lg m-2"
					>
						<img
							src="/shop.avif"
							class="absolute -rotate-6 size-28 md:size-40 z-20 group-hover:-rotate-12 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"
							width={50}
							height={50}
							alt="Mercado"
						/>
					</div>
					<p class="text-black text-lg text-center">
						<b class="group-hover:underline">Mercado</b>
					</p>
				</a>
				<a href="/servicios/farmacia" class="w-fit flex flex-col group">
					<div
						class="relative hover:cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 hover:contrast-125 transition z-10 col-span-2 min-h-[100px] min-w-[100px] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#42a838] via-[#348e2b] to-[#2b7025] p-2 w-fit border rounded-lg m-2"
					>
						<img
							src="/farmacia.avif"
							class="absolute -rotate-6 size-28 md:size-40 z-20 group-hover:-rotate-12 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"
							width={50}
							height={50}
							alt="Farmacia"
						/>
					</div>
					<p class="text-black text-lg text-center">
						<b class="group-hover:underline">Farmacia</b>
					</p>
				</a>
				<a
					href="/servicios/carniceria"
					class="w-fit flex flex-col group"
				>
					<div
						class="relative hover:cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 hover:contrast-125 transition z-10 col-span-2 min-h-[100px] min-w-[100px] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e43e33] via-[#f44a3f] to-[#fc766d] p-2 w-fit border rounded-lg m-2"
					>
						<img
							src="/meat.avif"
							class="absolute -rotate-6 size-28 md:size-40 z-20 group-hover:-rotate-12 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"
							width={50}
							height={50}
							alt="Carniceria"
						/>
					</div>
					<p class="text-black text-lg text-center">
						<b class="group-hover:underline">Carniceria</b>
					</p>
				</a>
				<a href="/servicios/24horas" class="w-fit flex flex-col group">
					<div
						class="relative hover:cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 hover:contrast-125 transition z-10 col-span-2 min-h-[100px] min-w-[100px] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3ad5ff] via-[#1ac4f6] to-[#00a7dc] p-2 w-fit border rounded-lg m-2"
					>
						<img
							src="/24.avif"
							class="absolute -rotate-6 size-28 md:size-40 z-20 group-hover:-rotate-12 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"
							width={50}
							height={50}
							alt="24 Horas"
						/>
					</div>
					<p class="text-black text-lg text-center">
						<b class="group-hover:underline">24 Horas</b>
					</p>
				</a>
				<a
					href="/servicios/verduleria"
					class="w-fit flex flex-col group"
				>
					<div
						class="relative hover:cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 hover:contrast-125 transition z-10 col-span-2 min-h-[100px] min-w-[100px] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#42a838] via-[#348e2b] to-[#2b7025] p-2 w-fit border rounded-lg m-2"
					>
						<img
							src="/verduleria.avif"
							class="absolute -rotate-6 size-28 md:size-40 z-20 group-hover:-rotate-12 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"
							width={50}
							height={50}
							alt="Verduleria"
						/>
					</div>
					<p class="text-black text-lg text-center">
						<b class="group-hover:underline">Verduleria</b>
					</p>
				</a>
				<a href="/servicios/libreria" class="w-fit flex flex-col group">
					<div
						class="relative hover:cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 hover:contrast-125 transition z-10 col-span-2 min-h-[100px] min-w-[100px] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#bea78e] via-[#ccbca5] to-[#e0d7c8] p-2 w-fit border rounded-lg m-2"
					>
						<img
							src="/utiles.avif"
							class="absolute -rotate-6 size-28 md:size-40 z-20 group-hover:-rotate-12 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"
							width={50}
							height={50}
							alt="Libreria"
						/>
					</div>
					<p class="text-black text-lg text-center">
						<b class="group-hover:underline">Libreria</b>
					</p>
				</a>
				<a
					href="/servicios/licoreria"
					class="w-fit flex flex-col group"
				>
					<div
						class="relative hover:cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 hover:contrast-125 transition z-10 col-span-2 min-h-[100px] min-w-[100px] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e14715] via-[#f0611f] to-[#f38244] p-2 w-fit border rounded-lg m-2"
					>
						<img
							src="/licor.avif"
							class="absolute -rotate-6 size-28 md:size-40 z-20 group-hover:-rotate-12 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"
							width={50}
							height={50}
							alt="Licoreria"
						/>
					</div>
					<p class="text-black text-lg text-center">
						<b class="group-hover:underline">Licoreria</b>
					</p>
				</a>
				<a
					href="/servicios/lavanderia"
					class="w-fit flex flex-col group"
				>
					<div
						class="relative hover:cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 hover:contrast-125 transition z-10 col-span-2 min-h-[100px] min-w-[100px] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e14715] via-[#f0611f] to-[#f38244] p-2 w-fit border rounded-lg m-2"
					>
						<img
							src="/limpieza.avif"
							class="absolute -rotate-6 size-28 md:size-40 z-20 group-hover:-rotate-12 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"
							width={50}
							height={50}
							alt="Limpieza"
						/>
					</div>
					<p class="text-black text-lg text-center">
						<b class="group-hover:underline">Lavanderia</b>
					</p>
				</a>
				<a
					href="/servicios/panaderia"
					class="w-fit flex flex-col group"
				>
					<div
						class="relative hover:cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 hover:contrast-125 transition z-10 col-span-2 min-h-[100px] min-w-[100px] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ee4e00] via-[#ff6d0a] to-[#ff8e32] p-2 w-fit border rounded-lg m-2"
					>
						<img
							src="/pan.avif"
							class="absolute -rotate-6 size-28 md:size-40 z-20 group-hover:-rotate-12 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"
							width={50}
							height={50}
							alt="Panaderia"
						/>
					</div>
					<p class="text-black text-lg text-center">
						<b class="group-hover:underline">Panaderia</b>
					</p>
				</a>
				<a href="/servicios/mas" class="w-fit flex flex-col group">
					<div
						class="relative hover:cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 hover:contrast-125 transition z-10 col-span-2 min-h-[100px] min-w-[100px] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0c77ed] via-[#138efd] to-[#2aabff] p-2 w-fit border rounded-lg m-2"
					>
						<img
							src="/more.avif"
							class="absolute -rotate-6 size-28 md:size-40 z-20 group-hover:-rotate-12 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"
							width={50}
							height={50}
							alt="Mas"
						/>
					</div>
					<p class="text-black text-lg text-center">
						<b class="group-hover:underline">Más</b>
					</p>
				</a>
				<div class="w-fit flex flex-col group">
					<div
						class="relative hover:cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 hover:contrast-125 transition z-10 col-span-2 min-h-[100px] min-w-[100px] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#474d57] blur-[4px] via-[#535c67] to-[#616d79] p-2 w-fit border rounded-lg m-2"
					>
						<img
							src="/burger.avif"
							class="absolute -rotate-6 size-28 md:size-40 z-20 group-hover:-rotate-12 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"
							width={50}
							height={50}
							alt="Mas"
						/>
					</div>
					<p class="text-black text-lg text-center">
						<b class="group-hover:underline">Proximo</b>
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<br id="informacion" class="" />
		<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center my-6 mx-4">
			🛒 Información para el Usuario
		</h2>
		<div class="lg:w-full lg:flex lg:justify-center">
			<div class="lg:mx-auto">
				<Carouselchill />
			</div>
		</div>
		<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 mt-4">
			<div
				class="grid gap-2 grid-cols-1
           sm:grid-cols-2
           lg:grid-cols-4
           auto-rows-[250px] lg:auto-rows-[230px]"
			>
				<!-- Quiénes Somos -->
				<div
					class="rounded-xl shadow-md p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-100 to-teal-50
            flex flex-col transition duration-300 ease-out
            hover:scale-[1.03] hover:shadow-xl hover:saturate-150"
				>
					<h3
						class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-700"
					>
						👤 Quiénes Somos
					</h3>
					<p
						class="text-gray-700 text-sm overflow-y-auto pr-1 transition duration-300 hover:text-gray-900"
					>
						En Mandados Ahora brindamos un servicio local de compras
						y envíos en San Miguel del Monte, pensado para ofrecer
						comodidad, rapidez, una atención amable y directa.
						Nuestro objetivo es que recibas tus productos.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Por Qué Elegirnos -->
				<div
					class="rounded-xl shadow-md p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-100 to-teal-100
            flex flex-col transition duration-300 ease-out
            hover:scale-[1.03] hover:shadow-xl hover:saturate-150"
				>
					<h3
						class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 transition-all duration-300 hover:text-cyan-700"
					>
						✅ Por Qué Elegirnos
					</h3>
					<ul
						class="text-gray-700 text-sm overflow-y-auto pr-1 transition duration-300 hover:text-gray-900"
					>
						<li>1 - Servicio 100% local, confiable y cercano.</li>
						<li>2 - Entregas rápidas y responsables.</li>
						<li>3 - Atención personalizada en cada pedido.</li>
						<li>4 - Comunicación directa, sin intermediarios.</li>
						<li>
							5 - Cuidado total de los productos hasta tu puerta.
						</li>
						<li>
							6 - Transparencia en precios, tiempos y condiciones.
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<!-- Cómo Trabajamos -->
				<div
					class="rounded-xl shadow-md p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100 to-cyan-50
            flex flex-col lg:col-span-1 sm:row-span-2 md:row-span-1
            transition duration-300 ease-out
            hover:scale-[1.03] hover:shadow-xl hover:saturate-150"
				>
					<h3
						class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 transition-all duration-300 hover:text-sky-700"
					>
						🛵 Cómo Trabajamos
					</h3>
					<ul
						class="text-gray-700 text-sm overflow-y-auto pr-1 space-y-1 transition duration-300 hover:text-gray-900"
					>
						<li>
							1 - Nos enviás tu pedido por mensaje o formulario.
						</li>
						<li>
							2 - Retiramos los productos del comercio
							correspondiente.
						</li>
						<li>3 - Verificamos estado y embalaje.</li>
						<li>4 - Entrega rápida y segura en tu domicilio.</li>
						<li>
							5 - Te mantenemos informado durante todo el proceso.
						</li>
						<li>6 - Entregamos el recibo del comercio.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<!-- Medios de Pago -->
				<div
					class="rounded-xl shadow-md p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-100 to-lime-50
            flex flex-col col-span-1 transition duration-300 ease-out
            hover:scale-[1.03] hover:shadow-xl hover:saturate-150"
				>
					<h3
						class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 transition-all duration-300 hover:text-green-700"
					>
						💵 Medios de Pago
					</h3>
					<ul
						class="text-gray-700 text-sm overflow-y-auto pr-1 space-y-1 transition duration-300 hover:text-gray-900"
					>
						<li>1 - Pago en efectivo al recibir el pedido.</li>
						<li>2 - Transferencia bancaria (CBU/Alias).</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<!-- Seguridad -->
				<div
					class="rounded-xl shadow-md p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-100 to-indigo-50
            flex flex-col md:col-span-2 transition duration-300 ease-out
            hover:scale-[1.03] hover:shadow-xl hover:saturate-150"
				>
					<h3
						class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 transition-all duration-300 hover:text-indigo-700"
					>
						🛡 Compromiso con la Seguridad
					</h3>
					<ul
						class="space-y-1 text-gray-700 text-sm overflow-y-auto pr-1 transition duration-300 hover:text-gray-900"
					>
						<li>
							1 - Protección de datos personales y de contacto.
						</li>
						<li>2 - Manejamos cada pedido con responsabilidad.</li>
						<li>3 - Verificamos productos antes de entregarlos.</li>
						<li>4 - Te informamos cada paso del proceso.</li>
						<li>5 - Solo personal autorizado realiza entregas.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<!-- Nuestra Misión -->
				<div
					class="rounded-xl shadow-md p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-emerald-50
            flex flex-col sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 sm:max-h-[150px]
            transition duration-300 ease-out
            hover:scale-[1.03] hover:shadow-xl hover:saturate-150"
				>
					<h3
						class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 transition-all duration-300 hover:text-emerald-700"
					>
						⭐ Nuestra Misión
					</h3>
					<p
						class="text-gray-700 text-sm overflow-y-auto pr-1 transition duration-300 hover:text-gray-900"
					>
						Brindar un servicio de mandados que facilite la vida
						diaria de nuestros clientes, ofreciendo rapidez,
						confianza y atención humana. Buscamos apoyar a los
						comercios locales y ser una solución accesible y segura
						para todos los vecinos de San Miguel del Monte.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</body>
</Layout>
